assets/illustrations/*.svg
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Four drawings from unDraw (https://undraw.co), by Katerina Limpitsouni,
under the unDraw licence: https://undraw.co/license

unDraw is free for commercial and personal use and requires no attribution;
this entry is here for completeness, and because the files have been
modified. Every fill has been rewritten to a palette role (__INK__,
__SURFACE__, __ACCENT__ and so on) so the app can resolve them against the
live theme, which means they are no longer valid SVGs as shipped. The
originals, their unDraw slugs, and the script that refetches them are
documented in assets/illustrations/README.md.
